      "duration": 8,
      "usage_rule": "Use to save yourself in an emergency or after a mistake, or in Mythic+ as a pseudo healing cooldown since removing yourself from the heal load is roughly a 20% group damage reduction; it also fully immunes Blessing of Sacrifice transfer damage.",
